    <string name="curve_mode_intro_title">Curve mode (experimental)</string>
    <string name="curve_mode_intro_text">• Starts a small helper that runs as root through the built-in Odin service and passes your controller on with your curves.\n• Turn it on before the game. Switching during a game can make the game lose the controller.\n• StickLab adds its virtual controller to a list in the AYN system, otherwise AYN’s service would take it over. “Restore everything” removes it.\n• To stop: this switch, Stop in the notification, or restart your Odin. It never starts by itself.</string>
