    <string name="profiles_help_title">How profiles work</string>
    <string name="profiles_help_text">1. A profile keeps your settings: deadzone, trigger, sensitivity, M1/M2 and curves.\n2. Adjust them in Sticks and Buttons – changes work on your Odin right away.\n3. Happy with it? Tap “Save to profile” at the top (or “Save current” in Profiles).\n4. The top line shows your profile – “changed” means your Odin no longer matches it.\n5. Up to 4 profiles, e.g. one per kind of game. “Use” switches to one, “Edit” also opens Sticks.\nTap “?” at the top to see this again.</string>
