    <string name="intro_title">Welcome to StickLab</string>
    <string name="intro_text">StickLab adjusts your sticks and triggers, sets up M1/M2, keeps it all in up to 4 profiles and lets the stick LEDs follow the colors on screen.\n\n• Works only on the AYN Odin 3. It uses a system service that is built into the device, no root needed.\n• For Ambilight, Android gives the app a tiny live copy of the screen (96×54 pixels). Nothing is saved or sent anywhere.\n• Use at your own risk.</string>
    <string name="unsupported_title">Device not supported</string>
    <string name="unsupported_text">StickLab only works on the AYN Odin 3, and this device was not recognized as one. To be safe, StickLab sends nothing to it, so the settings have no effect here.</string>

